WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.190
Speaker 1: So many things happening from the
standpoint of vaccine requirements and mandates,

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:09.030
the big news yesterday is that New York City
will be mandating vaccines.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:14.969
If you want to go to restaurants, if you want
to go to gyms, and if you want to go to most

00:00:14.969 --> 00:00:17.280
indoor entertainment type venues.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:23.640
New York City Mayor Bill de Blasio mandating
covid vaccines for certain indoor activities.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:28.530
The order goes into effect August 16th with
full enforcement starting September 13th.

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:35.250
De Blasio says the mandate, known as the key
to NYC pass, would encourage increased immunizations

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.200
to combat the spread of the Delta coronavirus
variant.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:44.710
The mayor's order comes a day after de Blasio
mandated vaccinations for all of the city's

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:45.930
new hires.

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:52.170
De Blasio added the city will begin inspecting
businesses for compliance in mid-September.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:56.690
All affected customers and workers can either
provide their vaccination cards or upload

00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:00.530
proof of vaccination to the Excelsior Pass
application.

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:04.129
New York City is thought to be the first in
the nation to implement such a mandate.

00:01:04.129 --> 00:01:08.570
Joe Biden responded affirmatively when asked
at a press conference yesterday if he believed

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:10.799
other cities should follow suit.

00:01:10.799 --> 00:01:14.850
But stakeholders across the food industry
raised concerns about how the program will

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:15.850
work.

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:19.850
They are overwhelmingly concerned about their
saying, listen, this is not like checking

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:23.619
an ID to make sure someone's really 21 before
you serve them alcohol.

00:01:23.619 --> 00:01:24.870
This is much more invasive.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.670
It's going to really affect restaurants.

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:30.119
But needless to say, de Blasio is going forward
with it.

00:01:30.119 --> 00:01:33.770
I believe it will encourage more people to
get vaccinated.

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:38.670
Here is Bill de Blasio talking about this
yesterday during a press conference.

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:44.810
Speaker 2: This is crucial because we know
this will encourage more vaccination.

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:47.159
We've seen it already.

00:01:47.159 --> 00:01:51.869
We've seen the impact of the mandate we've
put in place for city workers already starting

00:01:51.869 --> 00:01:53.340
to move people to vaccination.

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:57.689
We've obviously seen the positive impact of
incentive as well.

00:01:57.689 --> 00:02:03.619
The goal here is to convince everyone that
this is the time of stop the Delta and the

00:02:03.619 --> 00:02:04.619
time is now.

00:02:04.619 --> 00:02:07.170
And that means getting vaccinated right now.

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:11.319
This new policy will be phased in over the
coming weeks.

00:02:11.319 --> 00:02:14.360
So we've been working with the business community,
getting input.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.860
We're going to do more over the next few weeks.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:23.600
The final details of the policy will be announced
and implemented in the week of August 16th.

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:27.810
Speaker 1: OK, so without question, this is
happening.

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:33.459
The question the questions are how is it going
to be implemented and how is it going to be

00:02:33.459 --> 00:02:35.140
enforced?

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:39.460
New York Times also writing New York City
will require workers and customers to show

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:44.340
proof of at least one dose for indoor dining
and other activities.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:46.770
We are seeing other examples of this as well.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:52.700
A growing number of Los Angeles restaurants
and bars are themselves requiring proof of

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:54.720
covid-19 vaccination.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:03:01.170
Microsoft will require proof of vaccination
to enter their buildings in the United States.

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:04.920
The full opening of its offices will be no
earlier than October 4th.

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:06.970
So they've got a couple of months.

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:11.940
Tyson Foods will be mandating vaccines for
its U.S. workforce.

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:22.300
We know that food processing plants were big
points of spread relatively early in the pandemic.

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:24.420
So this is happening.

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:27.190
The questions are how will the enforcement
work?

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:30.569
And I know a lot of you have been emailing
me saying, David, you know, it's really easy

00:03:30.569 --> 00:03:32.760
to forge vaccine cards.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:35.730
It's not only easy, theoretically, it's already
happening.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:39.849
We already are aware of all sorts of stories
of people having and presenting fake vaccine

00:03:39.849 --> 00:03:40.849
cards.

00:03:40.849 --> 00:03:42.650
So there's no doubt that it will happen to
some degree.

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:47.870
But the point here is, you know, you put a
welfare social insurance system in place.

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:49.830
There will be some people who misuse it.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.960
But does it do good at the macro level?

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.570
You put something like this in place.

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:56.890
Will some people lie about being vaccinated
and get away with it?

00:03:56.890 --> 00:03:59.410
Yes, but they're already not vaccinated.

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:03.319
If you incentivize a bunch of people to go
and do it, we are slowing the spread and hopefully

00:04:03.319 --> 00:04:04.720
getting beyond the pandemic.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.550
So it's happening.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.430
We will see how it all rolls out.

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:12.470
And there is no doubt that you will continue
to see protests and more.

00:04:12.470 --> 00:05:19.590
There are some who are calling this Nazi like
and we will get to that a little bit later,

